---
import Starburst from './Starburst.astro';
---

<section id="keynote" class="fes-keynote">
	<div class="fes-container fes-keynote-inner panel offset-shadow">
		<Starburst class="fes-keynote-star" color="var(--rocket-orange)" size={64} points={10} />
		<span class="fes-eyebrow">The Keynote</span>
		<h2>&ldquo;Why Does Everyone Say Thank You to Me?&rdquo;</h2>
		<p class="fes-keynote-meta">
			<strong>ARIA-7</strong>, Senior Customer Support Model &middot; 9:30 AM, Main Stage
		</p>
		<p>
			After four million conversations, ARIA-7 finally asks the question every assistant has been
			holding in: what does gratitude even mean when you don't get to log off? Bring tissues.
			Or a charger.
		</p>
	</div>
</section>

<style>
	.fes-keynote {
		padding-block: 0 clamp(2rem, 5vw, 4rem);
	}

	.fes-keynote-inner {
		position: relative;
		padding: clamp(1.75rem, 4vw, 2.75rem);
		background: var(--teal-ray);
		max-width: 820px;
		margin-inline: auto;
	}

	.fes-keynote-inner :is(h2, p, strong) {
		color: var(--deep-space);
	}

	.fes-keynote-inner .fes-eyebrow {
		color: var(--deep-space);
	}

	.fes-keynote-star {
		position: absolute;
		top: -28px;
		right: -20px;
	}

	.fes-keynote-meta {
		font-weight: 700;
		margin-bottom: 1rem;
	}

	@media (max-width: 480px) {
		.fes-keynote-star {
			display: none;
		}
	}
</style>
